---
import Layout from '../layouts/BlogPost.astro';
---

<Layout
	title="About Me"
	description="Network Engineer specializing in IT infrastructure and support"
>
	<p>
		Hi, I'm Chris Tran, a Network Engineer at Auto-Chlor System. I have been with the company since October 2022, serving as a 
		Junior Network Engineer before my promotion in December 2025. With over 5 years of IT expertise and background in team 
		leadership, I specialize in network administration, design, and deployment.
	</p>

	<p>
		In my current role, I serve as a central point of escalation for technical issues, handling everything from end-user support 
		to complex network operations. My technical skillset includes Microsoft Windows AD, PowerShell, Bash, TCP/IP, VPN, and FORTINET 
		equipment. I also manage mobile devices using Samsung Knox MDM, deploy virtual machines and physical host servers, and lead 
		project management initiatives. My experience includes providing 24/7 on-call support and collaborating with senior engineers 
		on system architecture.
	</p>

	<p>
		My educational background includes pursuing an M.S. in Information Technology Management at Western Governors 
		University (expected 2027), building upon my B.S. in Mathematics-Computer Science from UC San Diego. I hold several 
		certifications including CompTIA A+, ITIL 4 Foundation, and Google IT Support, demonstrating my commitment to continuous learning.
	</p>

	<p>
		Throughout my career at organizations like Microsoft, Santa Clara County, and Amazon, I've developed a reputation for being 
		detail-oriented and adaptable. I am passionate about building systems that are not only functional—but scalable, secure, and 
		human-friendly—and implementing innovative solutions to enhance operational efficiency.
	</p>

	<div class="contact-section">
		<h2>Get in Touch</h2>
		<p>
			I'm always open to discussing new opportunities and networking with fellow IT professionals. 
			Feel free to reach out through my social links or email me at <a href="mailto:career@christran.io">career@christran.io</a>
		</p>
	</div>
</Layout>

<style>
	.contact-section {
		margin-top: 3rem;
		padding: 1.5rem;
		background: rgba(var(--gray-light), 0.1);
		border-radius: 8px;
	}
	.contact-section h2 {
		margin-top: 0;
		font-size: 1.5em;
	}
</style>
